2. Type 2 diabetes.
- Medical Reasoning: The patient has been trying to manage his type 2 diabetes with diet and exercise.
- Patient Education and Counseling: I recommended he continue to follow up with his primary care provider for continued management of his diabetes. I also recommended he follow up with his endocrinologist.
- Medical Treatment: Continue current management of his type 2 diabetes.

Patient Agreements: The patient understands and agrees with the recommended medical treatment plan.

INSTRUCTIONS

The patient will follow up with me in one week for a postoperative visit. }}<|eot_id|>
